{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The yearly changes in the population census of a town for four consecutive years are, \nrespectively, 25% increase, 25% increase, 25% decrease, 25% decrease. \nThe net change over the four years, to the nearest percent, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/a/c6a7c6d2bca5eaf958fc4bbff71f93e257daca0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -12 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"411\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A 25% increase means the new population is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/3628e955d7e4a0e6322ada48bc33c003f9b25dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> of the original population.  A 25% decrease means the new population is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> of the original population.\n</p><p>Thus, after four years, the population is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/5094879c8989686c27412818797e0d6ba4a8228d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{225}{256}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"167\" height=\"38\" /> times the original population.\n</p><p>Thus, the net change is -12%, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>Two successive increases of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> multiply the population by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/0/5b01d146173a33e72d5d118a4e01c6ab2a7d5b87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5/4)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"21\" />, while two successive decreases of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> multiply it by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34878efa8be747b70da21e79102050a5a2147bb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3/4)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"21\" />. The overall multiplier is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bfaa4c88461d2524b9943d4b931b2d7aec1a769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac54\\right)^2\\left(\\frac34\\right)^2=\\frac{225}{256}\\approx0.879.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"224\" height=\"48\" />\nThus the final population is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f11bb169151ec4d50835f17282fb1103fd7ce65c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$87.9\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> of the original, a decrease of about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/a/5aa1ee4165d7f8cc0a77830ce936ab3d152b9858.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12.1\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the closest choice is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3b50e67de79140664319e999de1c0f0745af50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-12\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <